      "text": "As per the prosecution story, complainant on 13/10/2021 made a complaint at police station Barkheda by stating that present applicant, Patwari Govardhan and other co-accused persons manipulated in the land record of the agriculturists and obtained loan from the bank on the forged documents and they have committed cheating with the complainant. Accordingly, a case has been registered against the present applicant and other co-accused persons.\nShyamubai vs The State Of Madhya Pradesh on 21 June, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/164052857/\n1 3.",
